{"path":"results/simple-ideas-14x12-p3-len4g3-comp0-8-bounties-from-7-scaling-ladder-20261024/summary.md","title":"Scaling: Very hard graph (14 × 12)","html":"<h1>Scaling: Very hard graph (14 × 12)</h1>\n<p><strong>Question:</strong> On a very hard idea graph, how does what each society achieves grow with its budget (1250 to 160000)?</p>\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> At budgets 1250–20000: best OSO (α = 0.2, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste. At budget 40000: best α = 1, β = 1. Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste. At budget 80000: best OSO (α = 0.2, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste. At budget 160000: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste. (Compared at each budget; 8 measures, a clear difference is more than 2.7 standard errors.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget 1250: hardest level: 7.27 against traditional 0.00, clearly better. targets solved: 0.27 against traditional 0.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 2500: hardest level: 8.63 against traditional 0.23, clearly better. targets solved: 1.60 against traditional 0.03, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 5000: hardest level: 10 against traditional 0.00, clearly better. targets solved: 3.67 against traditional 0.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 10000: hardest level: 12 against traditional 2.67, clearly better. targets solved: 6.40 against traditional 0.40, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 20000: hardest level: 13 against traditional 7.73, clearly better. targets solved: 9.87 against traditional 2.67, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 40000: hardest level: 14 against traditional 9.70, clearly better. targets solved: 13 against traditional 6.23, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 80000: hardest level: 14 against traditional 12, clearly better. targets solved: 15 against traditional 8.97, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 160000: hardest level: 14 against traditional 13, clearly better. targets solved: 16 against traditional 12, clearly better.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"files/results/simple-ideas-14x12-p3-len4g3-comp0-8-bounties-from-7-scaling-ladder-20261024/figures/compare.svg\" alt=\"Scaling: Very hard graph (14 × 12)\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>society</th>\n<th>budget</th>\n<th>frontier</th>\n<th>targets solved</th>\n<th>value gained</th>\n<th>ROI (value per spend)</th>\n<th>knowledge (bits)</th>\n<th>bits per money</th>\n<th>cost</th>\n<th>waste</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>1250</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.00</td>\n<td>55 ± 7</td>\n<td>0.044 ± 0.006</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.25 ± 0.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>2500</td>\n<td>0.2 ± 1.3</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.2</td>\n<td>9 ± 47</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.02</td>\n<td>78 ± 8</td>\n<td>0.031 ± 0.003</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.37 ± 0.04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>5000</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.00</td>\n<td>128 ± 15</td>\n<td>0.026 ± 0.003</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.46 ± 0.03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>10000</td>\n<td>2.7 ± 3.6</td>\n<td>0.4 ± 0.6</td>\n<td>162 ± 383</td>\n<td>0.02 ± 0.04</td>\n<td>212 ± 15</td>\n<td>0.021 ± 0.002</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.51 ± 0.02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>20000</td>\n<td>7.7 ± 2.3</td>\n<td>2.7 ± 1.4</td>\n<td>1297 ± 1050</td>\n<td>0.06 ± 0.05</td>\n<td>328 ± 28</td>\n<td>0.016 ± 0.001</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.53 ± 0.03</td>\n</tr